ed on recently. The assignee and the ticket's followers can't nudge it."],[106,"Replace someone's working hours and pause on ticket assignment. Send every field: what you send replaces what was set. People who work tickets can set their own. Leads can set it for the people in the queues they lead. Administrators can set anyone's in the organization."],[673,"Replace the text of a comment you posted, by the id the ticket's comments give. Only the person who wrote a comment can change it."],[74,"Request body"],[103,"Request body"],[151,"Request body"],[350,"Request body"],[430,"Request body"],[545,"Request body"],[575,"Request body"],[670,"Request body"],[709,"Request body"],[740,"Request body"],[978,"Request body"],[1129,"Request body"],[1194,"Request body"],[42,"Response 200"],[75,"Response 200"],[104,"Response 200"],[251,"Response 200"],[323,"Response 200"],[351,"Response 200"],[404,"Response 200"],[431,"Response 200"],[546,"Response 200"],[614,"Response 200"],[640,"Response 200"],[671,"Response 200"],[710,"Response 200"],[799,"Response 200"],[846,"Response 200"],[880,"Response 200"],[932,"Response 200"],[954,"Response 200"],[1022,"Response 200"],[1050,"Response 200"],[1073,"Response 200"],[1106,"Response 200"],[1130,"Response 200"],[1195,"Response 200"],[152,"Response 201"],[576,"Response 201"],[741,"Response 201"],[979,"Response 201"],[1329,"Script it: JSON out, exit codes, safe retries with an idempotency key."],[1348,"Security issues: security@stlabs.com, see https://stlabs.com/security."],[100,"Set availability"],[38,"Set someone's availability `/people/{person}/availability`"],[401,"Set the default queue"],[1261,"Shape the output"],[1256,"Sign in"],[331,"Somebody who works a queue."],[108,"Somebody's availability, in full. Every field is required; what you send replaces what was set."],[44,"Someone's working hours, and whether ticket assignment is paused for them. Anyone who never set their availability comes back with empty hours and no pause, not an error. P